1. `arrList.Add(x);` - <code>Debug.Assert(New_Ret > 0 && New_arrListCount == Old_arrListCount + 1);</code>
2. `arrList.Remove(x);` - <code>Debug.Assert(New_arrListCount == Old_arrListCount - 1);</code>
3. `arrList.Insert(index, x);` - <code>Debug.Assert(New_arrListCount == Old_arrListCount + 1);</code>
